  "prefLabel": "Saf-C 9708.01 Recordkeeping",
  "priorExpiration": "2022-07-28",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Saf-C 9708.01 Recordkeeping.\n\n(a) All grantees shall maintain all records related to their grant application and any financial records related to the implementation of body-worn or dashboard camera funds pursuant to RSA 105-D:3 and these rules, for a period of at least 3 years.\n\n(b) Grant and supporting documentation shall be made available for inspection and audit by a representative of the department upon request during the grantee’s business hours, no later than the next business day.\n\nSource. #13338, INTERIM, eff 1-29-22, EXPIRES: 7-28-22; ss by #13365, eff 4-18-22",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/saf-c9700.html"
